      "message": "This is only safe if we are sure this page exists in the vmemmap, i.e. if it is a memory page.\n\nWe should probably forbid sharing non-memory pages with the hypervisor (like we forbid donating non-memory pages).\n\nSo we should add a find_mem_range() check to host_initiate_share(), like we have in host_initiate_donation()? (probably in the previous patch.)\n\nBTW host_request_donation()/host_request_share() seems a more suitable place for this check than host_initiate_donation()/host_initiate_share(). So we could also clean this up while we\u0027re at it... OTOH, who cares. In 6.15 we removed all these layers of wrappers anyway.",
